# Autonomous loop

Repeat this loop until every part of the request is done and checked. Do not stop between passes to ask a question you can answer from the code or the live app.

1. Research the owning code and the current page on https://vantagefrc.vercel.app.
2. Make the change.
3. Use the changed flow on the hosted app, including the edge case that would make it feel finicky.
4. If it fails or feels indirect, fix it and use it again.

When the loop is green, commit only the files for that task and push the current branch. Leave unrelated dirty files unstaged. Do not commit secrets. Do not force-push. Do not start a background timer that keeps committing.

On this laptop, do not start a local database, dev server, test runner, or build unless the user explicitly authorizes that workload.
